cando mas y mas contenido, la diversión no para. \nFOR ROCK AND STONE.. FOREVER!!!!!\n\n10/10", "timestamp_created": 1738848700, "timestamp_updated": 1764083298, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187233402", "author": {"steamid": "76561198144673334", "personaname": "Animatrix", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198144673334/", "num_games_owned": 421, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 29182, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 21321, "last_played": 1786640385, "avatar": "e3db3d462c46a368fd83ec0cc6fb59bcc55781eb"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Un ejemplo a seguir de cómo hacer un juego con live service. No tiene FOMO, es decir que no hay límites de tiempo para obtener cosméticos y los eventos te dan la oportunidad de obtener todas las skins de años anteriores, los \"pases de batalla\" son totalmente gratuitos y podés completar pases anteriores.\r\nLo único que se puede comprar con dinero real son paquetes de skins para apoyar a los desarrolladores.", "timestamp_created": 1738773861, "timestamp_updated": 1738773861, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187190195", "author": {"steamid": "76561198867503763", "personaname": "bob the builder", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198867503763/", "num_games_owned": 52, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 17201, "playtime_last_two_weeks"